description:
Two minor cleanup items from review loop iteration 3 (P3/P4 — not blocking).

1. glob_matches allocates on every call (routing_mailer.rs:76)
   format!(".{suffix_lower}") heap-allocates on every glob_matches call. Called per-recipient per-message. Fix:
     if let Some(without_suffix) = domain_lower.strip_suffix(suffix_lower.as_str()) {
         if let Some(label) = without_suffix.strip_suffix('.') {
             return !label.is_empty() && !label.contains('.');
         }
     }
     return false;

2. relay_client.rs and session.rs tests inline install_default instead of using install_ring_provider (smtp/src/relay_client.rs:520, smtp/src/session.rs:2226,2290,2369,2441)
   The relay_client.rs version emits a warn! on double-install which is wrong — double-install is routine in tests and the new helper silently ignores it. Update relay_client.rs and all four test sites to call stoa_tls::install_ring_provider() instead.
